{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model using scgpt as the RNA encoder in a multiprofile setting with transformer aggregation, building on prior evidence that scvi_n200 with transformer aggregation achieves 0.653 accuracy. Validation accuracy (0.5136) and F1 (0.4982) are lower than the scvi_n200 baseline, suggesting scgpt may not improve performance in this configuration. The impact of scgpt versus scvi_n200 remains uncertain without direct comparison, and the role of other design choices like fusion strategies is yet to be evaluated."
}

